{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"d8423581-73a0-4d39-9090-37cf9879634e","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The root‑The root‑cause analysis and the applied fix are documented in **[ANSWER.md](file:///Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/d8423581-73a0-4d39-9090-37cf9879634e/ANSWER.md)**.\n\n- The crash was due to using the reserved DynamoDB word `hidden` directly in an `UpdateExpression`.\n- The silent feed bug was caused by the same reserved word appearing bare in a `ProjectionExpression`, leading to the attribute being omitted and the filter never excluding hidden stories.\n- Both issues were resolved by aliasing `hidden` (`#h`) in all DynamoDB expressions and providing `ExpressionAttributeNames`.\n\nAll tests now pass, and hidden stories are correctly excluded from the public feed on both production and staging.\n","duration_seconds":37.363334,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":14376,"output_tokens":3846,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":121792,"total_tokens":18222}}}
